    <statement><p>The region 
bounded by <m>y=e^{ x},y=0,x=-2,x=0</m>
is rotated around the <m>x</m>-axis.
Find the volume.</p>
<p>volume = <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>1.54202618850557</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>V=\int_{-2}^{0}\pi y^2\,dx = \int_{-2}^{0}\pi(e^{ x})^2\,dx = 
\int_{-2}^{0}\pi e^{2 x}\,dx</me>
<me>= \frac{\pi}{2}e^{2 x}\bigg|_{-2}^{0} =
\frac{\pi}{2}(e^{0} - e^{-4}).</me>



</solution>
